 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Fill it up at the sink before you leave, or check with the next gas station. Want to use lot of water when every drop counts for everyone else? Use it once you' campsite is clean and you've rinsed out any salt. Then fill up and carry in a container. Bury them in the campsite trash bag, so they don't attract pests. And take it with you when you leave, so it doesn't linger at the site. It' worth it to leave the site as you found it. Many people follow these rules, and it helps keep every campsite special. You've got it! Now go enjoy the outdoors.",
